    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Defaults to [`CGSizeZero`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreGraphics/CGSizeZero), which indicates there is no limit on the video resolution.",
      "ko": "기본값은 [`CGSizeZero`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreGraphics/CGSizeZero)이며, 비디오 해상도에 제한이 없음을 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fe0b215cf01e726ee638107f2f22d737a8086f526610754f55f3c6c8d29e296c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Any other value indicates a preferred maximum video resolution.",
      "ko": "다른 모든 값은 선호되는 최대 비디오 해상도를 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a63e97b0dffcae6e0bc0fde6c9cda5fef878b1e085cfda4533b0a0941383c226",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "This property only applies to HTTP Live Streaming assets.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 HTTP Live Streaming 에셋에만 적용됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1d469f3713b00e100f455f1b75f6b313490257232ae52ff89a51ddcfee5aa16c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
